WEBVTT

00:04:59.169 --> 00:05:01.521
na tunao huu msemo,

00:05:01.521 --> 00:05:05.769
nafasi huja mara moja tu.

00:05:05.769 --> 00:05:08.468
Sawa,fikiria tena.

00:05:08.468 --> 00:05:12.890
Kila wakati ni zawadi mpya,tena na tena,

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:16.158
na kama utakosa nafasi ya wakati huu,

00:05:16.158 --> 00:05:20.175
wakati mwingine utakuja,na tena mwingine utakuja.

00:05:20.175 --> 00:05:22.889
Tunaweza pata nafasi tena

00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:24.760
au kukosa,

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:28.492
na kama tutaipata nafasi,

00:05:28.492 --> 00:05:31.511
ni ufunguo wa furaha.